9", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_2334058800454382_6810420958056556067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UVU9PY9MypEQ7kNvwHa9BmE&_nc_oc=AdpKyH5nzk9JSpVUzf72VTFzYwCwnhuQQyDu7dsN6eEKao9sJLo_q3G1axAT-Y_fYRE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLGM9Mr48AyNHwwW-tlo-MyYfdFwaobZ9CJSb5tNaUQVQ&oe=6ABA6CDB"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203353.png", "id": "1290753326156435", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1290753329489768_4332884711738293422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dvzIUdBbHMYQ7kNvwHXW6Pc&_nc_oc=Adrd5OboINjRIzNZuBT0GLw4PE2vWm8kovM1EYM-IAv11JlRRYzUYmULmgwyJz1S3l0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKkX4L4eFjVJawjHxPknFwUBOQTp1gfLk2IVeFZz4_2EQ&oe=6ABA6C81"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203201.png", "id": "1926405484733596", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1926405491400262_5342535590335345652_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WNQN9PrerC8Q7kNvwEoy2OZ&_nc_oc=AdoRKUWTGmnzZSLXMBRHwHiZNDtrMrAx5wpDxaFYrQnYa-KT7njC0scvFzt8qMQ3m1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLFsWJFrkxNBj7-6lC41Z56xoiUqZrwVw3Wd2KieH0i1g&oe=6ABA585D"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203301.png", "id": "974613512240519", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_974613515573852_1573452143751525995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CfCDHca_aIMQ7kNvwGBWKux&_nc_oc=AdrPgLreZJoA6MsVWA8L0lPzf9JwCT-ONDeWm3DuulRT1c_eSnq9QkkkS-46DCwWXzg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIJtcOPJ3lhyb6RaW_WHJrnemA9iv1LPyzlXV9_eEIbfw&oe=6ABA5A3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fields-artwork-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1690141432030718", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1690141435364051_2132099073325899983_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6jXXKTIFGaQQ7kNvwHSs3xQ&_nc_oc=AdpbbatJPHreCGbWBkNqHKO44FjuMnQBQkMSJGFv72ErfZIM0eFkUZp2I0C4FNJ8JDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLqZUPON_ov2D_MZADucdb4ZFCR3yQYO5MERjscF9EIRg&oe=6ABA86EE"}, "display_name": "Fields", "keywords": ["music", "inmersive", "art", "visuals", "meditation"], "long_description": "Fields is not an album you listen to. It is a place you enter.\n\nAn immersive VR experience built around the music of electronic producer Die Stadt, Fields dissolves the boundary between sound and space. Each track becomes an environment: shifting fields of light, generative textures, and slow chromatic movements that respond to the music in real time.\n\nFields is designed for deep listening \u2014 a rare kind of attention that VR makes possible. No narrative, no objectives. Only presence.\nWhat you will find inside:\n\n- A full-length electronic music album experienced as a living, breathing space.\n- Generative visuals that evolve with the music.\n- Designed for extended, contemplative sessions.\n- Optimized for Meta Quest 3.\n\nFields is an album. Fields is a place. Now you can enter both.\n\nStep in.\n{1548057873348580}", "short_description": "Step inside the music of electronic/ambient producer Die Stadt. Sound becomes space. Space becomes music."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2273186383217800", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_2273186386551133_8686410893456982869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UvAHw2MjnWoQ7kNvwEdrBzq&_nc_oc=AdrGDIrKER-zo7oLbf86jYrrpRmBg56dabkB3R-Lh7vWfj-uEF3FQsJ3LYDnZ2q5-5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIT-T2qtlI0syR_Ft1MrXXIAkfS4Y4bcSQIj_oiX0N-Tg&oe=6ABA7FDF"}, {"file_name": "fields_logotipo_512x512.png", "id": "2080711572861858", "image_type": "APP_IMG_L